@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title Input Source Popup Guard — GNOME Shell 46
actor "User" as user
package "GNOME Shell process" {
  component "Input source manager\nInputSourcePopup" as popup
  component "extension.js\nShell adapter" as adapter
  component "guard.js\nInputSourceGuard policy" as policy
  component "250 ms watchdog\nOnly while tracking popups" as timer
  component "Read-only GetState\nOptional RunSelfTest action" as diagnostics
}
actor "Diagnostic client" as client
user --> popup : Layout shortcut / selection
adapter --> policy : Inject runtime callbacks
policy --> popup : Hook show / finish / fade\nTrack and destroy own popups
popup --> policy : Navigation / destroy events
policy --> timer : Start / stop
 timer --> policy : Observe visibility and modifiers
policy --> popup : Recover stale popup\nPreserve newer manager reference
client --> diagnostics : Session D-Bus
 diagnostics --> adapter : Query state / request bounded test
adapter --> policy : State and cleanup
note bottom of policy
  Valid selection activates at most once.
  Other switchers and modal grabs stay outside scope.
  Disable restores hooks and removes owned timers.
end note
@enduml
